Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-157: laptop package 113's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.155-0.157 (0.157.0)

GitHub main b6dcba2 (GitLab 16debc74), mixed; its C++ / web part (with package 114's, which has no designer files)
= the integration session's 28ddd34 / cpp 0100. Three-way on the package's base_65330849 (= package 112), against the
tree as it is now, CRLF to LF first: 9 files changed only by ES02 and the new lib/items.js copied byte for byte;
CHANGELOG.md, HANDOVER.md, test/run_tests.js, test/smoke_extension.js on both sides (git merge-file, no conflict).
The machine's own patches, not yet taken by the laptop, all kept: tools 0136 (Alias list skips the "#" marker row
+ its test), tools 0143 (.claude skipped by the C++ index / project search / Solution Explorer + its test; the
smoke "lint all pages" counting the pages itself).
ES02's 0.155: a machine-screen frame in the designer (1920x1080 / 1280x1024 / ... / custom, red dashed, setting
ht9045Designer.screenSize); 0.156: set the Tab order by clicking (WinForms' View > Tab Order); 0.157: an Items /
Lines list editor for ComboBox, RadioGroup and Memo in the property grid.
Tests: lib 179/179, probe 7/7 + tab tree 7/7, extension 219/219, panels all pass; e2e_build.ps1 not run.

